.**************************************************
:help name='SNDPIPE/ERROR/MESSAGES'.
&msg(CPX0005,QCPFMSG). SNDPIPE - Help
:xh3.&msg(CPX0005,QCPFMSG). SNDPIPE
:p.:hp3.*ESCAPE &msg(CPX0006,QCPFMSG).:ehp3.
